Description: Download media with yt-dlp and push it straight to an rclone remote
 Downloads each URL with yt-dlp into its own staging directory, uploads it
 to an rclone remote, and deletes the local copy before moving on, so a long
 list of recordings never fills the disk. Reads URLs from arguments or a
 commented list file, supports cookie files for sites that need a signed-in
 session, and keeps going when one URL fails.

